        "## **4. Market Feedback Loops and Reflexivity**\n",
        "\n",
        "George Soros made billions recognizing what academics denied – markets affect the reality they're supposed to reflect. This reflexivity creates non-linearities that make physicists jealous (at least atoms don't read physics papers).\n",
        "\n",
        "### **4.1 Mathematical Framework**\n",
        "\n",
        "Let's formalize what Soros intuited. Start with three variables:\n",
        "- $F_t$: Fundamental value (what the asset \"should\" be worth)\n",
