        "$$F_{t+1} = F_t + k(P_t - F_t)$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Note how prices affect fundamentals through $k(\\cdot)$. This is the crucial insight – markets don't just discover prices, they create realities. A currency crisis becomes self-fulfilling. A credit boom enables the very investments that justify higher valuations (until they don't).\n",
        "\n",
        "### **4.2 Examples of Reflexive Processes**\n",
        "\n",
