        "Algorithmic trading creates new forms of reflexivity. Similar models produce correlated trades. Correlated trades move prices. Price moves trigger stop-losses and rebalancing. More algorithms pile in (or out). Flash crashes result – reflexivity compressed from months to milliseconds.\n",
